{"dept":"storage","fams":{"F348":{"codes":[["SP766101","Multi-purpose mobile panel stand"]],"photos":[["p380_01",371,400,["SP766101"]]]},"F349":{"codes":[["SP780435","Mobile bumper stand (1 unit)"]],"photos":[["p380_02",621,325,["SP780435"]]]},"F350":{"desc":"New design. Easy to use. Compact model. Safely holds any body components that require painting.","acc":[["SP780052","Arm accessories"],["SP780053","Arm with clamp"],["SP780054","Flexible arm"]],"codes":[["SP780051","Slim multi-purpose panel stand"]],"photos":[["p380_03",630,374,["SP780051"]],["p380_04",200,344,["SP780051"]],["p380_05",257,332,["SP780051"]],["p380_06",242,308,["SP780051"]],["p380_07",266,286,["SP780051"]],["p380_08",156,350,["SP780053"]],["p380_09",136,352,["SP780054"]],["p380_10",368,222,["SP780052"]]]},"F351":{"codes":[["SP762711","Magnetic arm holder with clamp"]],"photos":[["p381_02",638,418,["SP762711"]]]},"F352":{"codes":[["SP780055","Small parts arm holder"]],"photos":[["p381_h01",629,524,["SP780055"]]]},"F353":{"desc":"The wheel painting stand allows for the 4 wheels to be painted even without removing the tires, optimizing both the repair and finishing works. The wheels can be rotated on the cone-shaped brackets, so they can be painted without lifting or removing the tire. The painting stand bars can be adjusted for optimum height, so the operator can find a comfortable working position. Thanks to its castors, it can be moved and placed inside the booths without having to carry heavy weights.","specs":[["Load capacity","100 kg (25 kg per wheel)"],["Dimensions","830 x 830 x 780 H mm"],["Castors","Set of 4 castors (2 of them with brake), 100 x 100 mm"]],"codes":[["SP766111","Wheel painting stand"]],"photos":[["p381_04",528,466,["SP766111"]]]},"F364":{"desc":"Guniwheel wheels have been developed to facilitate the work of all those who, due to a repair situation, need a universal rim to temporarily move their vehicle. With this tire, the vehicle can be moved at a maximum speed of 8 km/hour. It is compatible with 99% of current vehicles and can hold a maximum load of 1,588 kg per tire, which offers many possibilities. The functionality of the Guniwheel universal wheel is very simple, designed not to leave the car or van on stands. It is a new product that will streamline your work since it allows you to easily move from one place to another. No more having vehicles on the lifts for days! With Guniwheel's universal wheel there are no excuses to keep the garage or workshop full with spares.","features":["Made of thicker steel for more durability with an airless polyurethane rubber tire tread"],"acc":[["SP780045","Kit of 5 bolts M14 x 28 x 1.5"],["SP780046","Kit of 5 nuts M12"],["SP780047","Set of 6 washers"],["SP780049","Gunihub"]],"table":{"cols":["Model","Bolts","Capacity","Size","Weight","Center bore","Maximum speed"],"rows":[["SP780041","Guniwheel 45 S","for 4 and 5 bolts","1,588 kg","22.5\"D x 3\"W","15.5 kg","77 mm","8 km/h"],["SP780042","Guniwheel 56","for 5 and 6 bolts","1,134 kg","22.5\"D x 3\"W","14.5 kg","110 mm","8 km/h"],["SP780033","Guniwheel 80","for 8 bolts","1,588 kg","24.5\"D x 3.5\"W","19.5 kg","140 mm","8 km/h"]]},"codes":[["SP780041","Guniwheel 45 S universal wheel"],["SP780042","Guniwheel 56 universal wheel"],["SP780033","Guniwheel 80 universal wheel"]],"photos":[["p386_01",442,440,["SP780033"]],["p386_03",394,394,["SP780041"]],["p386_02",413,414,["SP780042"]],["p386_07",202,234,["SP780045"]],["p386_08",212,210,["SP780046"]],["p386_09",173,224,["SP780047"]],["p386_h01",224,203,["SP780049"]]]},"F365":{"desc":"The Guni X universal wheel has been developed to be able to service any type of vehicle thanks to its 3-in-1 concept (interchangeable universal wheel) and free hub rotation.","specs":[["Capacity","1,588 kg"],["Size","26\""],["Maximum speed","8 km/h"],["Bolt patterns","Gunix 45 for 4 and 5 bolts; Gunix 56 for 5 and 6 bolts; Gunix 80 for 8 bolts"]],"acc":[["SP780037","Gunihub X 45"],["SP780038","Gunihub X 56"],["SP780039","Gunihub